      },
      "text": "Personality refers to consistent patterns of thought, feeling, and behavior that\ndiffer between individuals and are relatively stable over time and contexts. The Big\nFive is the dominant empirical model — derived from factor analysis of language,\nreplicated across cultures, and predictively valid. MBTI is not this."
